    "body": "<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-requirements\">\n<p>You must have a paid Klaviyo account to use this feature.</p>\n</div>\n<p>Learn how to use Email AI to create AI-generated email content. This tool can create layouts including images, text blocks, and buttons.<br>\nThere are several Email AI features available, including template generation, text revision, and content creation. This article covers creating content (e.g., a layout including text and images). Learn more about <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/34411474977947\">text revision</a> or <a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/28242227715227\">template generation</a> in their respective articles.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JN1Q5R2R9T17NTYZ5BGEWKGA\">Before you begin</h2>\n<p>Email AI accepts descriptive, plain-text inputs and generates complete section layouts, ready for you to edit and finalize. Designs generated by this tool may include the following content: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Text blocks, including AI-generated copy </li>\n<li>Image blocks</li>\n<li>2- or 3-column layouts</li>\n<li>Button blocks</li>\n<li>Dividers</li>\n<li>Spacers</li>\n<li>Product blocks \n<ul>\n<li>Note that product blocks are not automatically configured. Before sending the template,<a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005082787\"> select a product feed</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other block types not listed here (e.g., table blocks) are not supported.</p>\n<p>The generated sections use the fonts, colors, and styles from your template’s <em>Styles</em> tab and are fully editable once you select a section layout.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JN1Q7KZEWG52V6XPB764RJQC\">Use AI to create email content</h2>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>This assistant creates email sections using generative AI technology, however you are still responsible for the final content.</p>\n</div>\n<ol>\n<ol>\n<li>If you'd like to generate new options based on your prompt, proceed to the 4th page and click <strong>Generate more drafts</strong>. To modify your description and generate additional options, click <strong>Update description</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<li>In an email built using Klaviyo’s drag-and-drop editor, add a section (or select an existing section).<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720660305307\" alt=\"AI section.jpg\" width=\"315\" height=\"157\">\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>If you select an existing section, its content will be replaced once you choose an AI-generated section. Click the undo icon within the editor to recover the original content.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>Click the AI icon (a star) next to the selected section.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/37118783273115\" alt=\"emailAI.jpg\">\n</li>\n<li>Input a text description of the section you’d like to generate, (e.g., “Create a sale reminder with urgency to order before midnight, and include an image at the top and a button right below”).</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Generate drafts</strong>. </li>\n<li>After a few moments, 3 options will appear. Use the arrows to toggle between these options. <br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720672023067\" alt=\"Generated option.jpg\" width=\"311\" height=\"423\">\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Insert draft</strong> to insert your preferred section content. </li>\n<li>Once you’ve selected a section and inserted it into the template, edit as needed (e.g., add images, add links to buttons, finalize copy, etc.) </li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JN1Q9JV08FX9RX8XSM39Z3HM\">Example prompts</h2>\n<p>Not sure where to start? Try these sample inputs to see what this tool can do. </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create a section with images and text laid out in a zigzag pattern. At the bottom, add a button encouraging readers to take a look. </li>\n<li>Create a friendly message with links to follow us on social media.</li>\n<li>Add 3 columns with a text block and a button in each one. Add in copy teasing an exciting new release.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JN1QA29Y37DB3KYEWPDV26MV\">Email AI limitations </h2>\n<p>Each Klaviyo user can generate up to 99 email sections per day using Email AI. Each entry generates 3 results, which means you can generate content 33 times in a 24-hour period. Once you reach this limit, wait 24 hours before trying again. </p>\n<p>Certain elements (like product blocks, images, links, and buttons) are not fully configured by the generation tool. You must add in these elements manually after selecting a generated section: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Products or feeds in a product block</li>\n<li>Images</li>\n<li>Alt text for images </li>\n<li>URLs for buttons and links</li>\n</ul>",
